{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Ignore undefined future fields when detecting error details.** The unknown-field branch is true even when its value is `undefined`, so `{ FutureDetail: undefined }` creates a `DurableOperationError(\"Unknown error\")` and spurious exception telemetry. Count only defined values, and update that unit case to expect `undefined`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-K9Kb","finding_digest":"d94b13925de13f929bcde1771412a3892a8f913b2055c6e240c5aba5c0f3547b","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","line":47,"observation_digest":"4af7f7f9aceb69698d9ef849fd5425d42cd40a595cd896733201bcb49b938e66","observation_id":"aro_v1_jl37p6nm5nuwtdm67be72vbf2q","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","published_at":"2026-10-13T21:36:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3qttcywyt2xdwnd5jm2xfft3jm","reviewed_base_sha":"5c28654e7911475c2f20e6b21ba0d28ce1dac664","reviewed_head_sha":"1e8fc828578fb41dd764bc08493930d3f75d1bd5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":43,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_dsnpfa444sunomxkbn4etah3ki"},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_zfetrb53dowost3v5ltjr6kq5q","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T21:36:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
